[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3891909501","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110760#issuecomment-3891909501","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110760","id":3891909501,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7n-dN9","user":{"login":"Roosader","id":50506176,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNTA2MTc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50506176?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roosader","html_url":"https://github.com/Roosader","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roosader/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roosader/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roosader/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roosader/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roosader/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roosader/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roosader/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roosader/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roosader/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-12T16:21:42Z","updated_at":"2026-02-12T16:21:42Z","body":"As a temporary solution for this, in Editor Settings, go to Interface -> Editor and then enable the \"Save on Focus Loss\" setting. That has saved me a couple times after I found it. This has been VERY frustrating but thankfully a bit less so now. Just return to your task screen or home screen and then go back into the editor and everything should be saved :)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3891909501/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4187730335","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110760#issuecomment-4187730335","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110760","id":4187730335,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc75m7Gf","user":{"login":"bludosDevv","id":246986704,"node_id":"U_kgDODri30A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246986704?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bludosDevv","html_url":"https://github.com/bludosDevv","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bludosDevv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bludosDevv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bludosDevv/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bludosDevv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bludosDevv/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bludosDevv/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bludosDevv/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bludosDevv/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bludosDevv/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-04T20:52:11Z","updated_at":"2026-04-04T20:52:11Z","body":"@syntaxerror247 \nI have some things to say that I have found out in few weeks in the codes. and have edited them to confirm if they work or not.\n\nTry to Fix Android editor input loss due to event pool exhaustion and missed mouse button release events.\n1st `InputEventRunnable` instances are leaking when queued to the render thread if it was already exiting or if the render view was null. This eventually exhausted the pool (`MAX_POOL_SIZE = 1200`), causing all OS-level inputs to be dropped before reaching Godot. This should be fixed by executing pending runnables on exit so they recycle.\n2nd In `core/input/input.cpp`, `mouse_button_mask` and `touch_velocity_track` are not cleared when the application lost focus (`release_pressed_events`). This left the engine perpetually thinking buttons were pressed, blocking new UI interactions.\n\nThanks for your time.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4187730335/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4187731640","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110760#issuecomment-4187731640","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110760","id":4187731640,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc75m7a4","user":{"login":"bludosDevv","id":246986704,"node_id":"U_kgDODri30A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246986704?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bludosDevv","html_url":"https://github.com/bludosDevv","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bludosDevv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bludosDevv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bludosDevv/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bludosDevv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bludosDevv/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bludosDevv/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bludosDevv/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bludosDevv/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bludosDevv/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-04T20:53:12Z","updated_at":"2026-04-04T20:53:12Z","body":"> As a temporary solution for this, in Editor Settings, go to Interface -> Editor and then enable the \"Save on Focus Loss\" setting. That has saved me a couple times after I found it. This has been VERY frustrating but thankfully a bit less so now. Just return to your task screen or home screen and then go back into the editor and everything should be saved :)\n\nthis helped alot. thanks ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4187731640/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]